Edudata-rwanda (c) 2026 Manthedan - Manzi Brian Bonheur.

Submitted to the NISR 2026 Big Data Hackathon. Under the competition rules, rights in the submitted work are assigned to the National Institute of Statistics of Rwanda (NISR).

Data credits: "Source: National Institute of Statistics of Rwanda (NISR)" for Census 2022 results and district boundaries; Ministry of Education (MINEDUC) Education Statistical Yearbook 2024/2025 for school figures; REB and NESA for books and past papers (links only).
